  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Our Leila crossbody bag does the everyday thing really, really well. With a slim profile and rounded shape, it's crafted in pebbled leather with a zip top closure and exterior slip pocket for the things you grab most. In other words, it carries what you need without the fluff.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Pebbled leather</li>\n<li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware (meringue, black); silver hardware (pomegranate, hot fudge, light frozen lilac)</li>\n<li><strong>Drop:</strong> Adjustable 22&quot; drop at center hole</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> Interior: 1 slip pocket</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 9.6&quot; (L) x 7.3&quot; (H) x 3.20&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
